msgstr "“%s” — это имя, зарезервированное WordPress; выберите другой ярлык."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:589
#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:641
#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:785
#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:829
